PM: Adding info for No Bus:gadget
musb_init_controller 2064: OTG mode, status 0, dev80
musb_hdrc musb_hdrc: USB OTG mode controller at fa0ab000 using DMA, IRQ 92

However, the port doesn't work: attached client devices aren't detected
(Wifi device via a USB hub, both worked with 2.6.33). I tried to change
the mode manually, but that didn't work either:

# cat /sys/bus/platform/devices/musb_hdrc/mode
b_idle
# echo host > /sys/bus/platform/devices/musb_hdrc/mode
# cat /sys/bus/platform/devices/musb_hdrc/mode
b_idle

lsusb doesn't show anything at all.

I would appreciate any help on how to fix or further debug this problem.

Regards,
Thomas Klute

